<section begin=intro />'''Guardian Armor''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Chroma}}'s {{A|Vex Armor}} that provides [[Damage Reduction]] to allies within [[Affinity Range]] while causing their kills to heal Chroma.<section end=intro />

