==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''Genius''' under {{Faction|Cephalon Suda}} or the rank of '''Partner''' under {{Faction|The Perrin Sequence}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*Duration is capped at current modded Vex Armor duration.
*Kills made by Chroma will trigger the duration increase and healing.
**However, kills made by Chroma's companions will not.
*Heal is {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''5%''' of max health over '''3''' seconds, which is {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''1.67%''' per second.
*Additional kills while the heal over time is active will refresh it; additional kills do not stack the heal over time.
*Damage reduction does <u>'''not'''</u> apply to Chroma; only squadmates benefit from it.
*Despite specifying squadmates, it does apply to defense objectives as well.
*Guardian armor can activate {{M|Archon Intensify}}, provided that {{Stat|Health}} is actually restored, which demands that the player first take damage.
**Restoring Health of ally Warframes or Companions will also grant the bonus.

==Patch History==
{{Scrollbox/Article|
{{ver|39}}
*Made the following changes to Chroma’s Guardian Armor Augment Mod:
**Chroma now '''reduces''' the damage his squadmates take within Affinity (50m) range by 75%. 
***''Previously, the negated damage was dealt to Chroma’s health. We’ve removed that mechanic. Due to Vex Armor now functioning with weapon kills, we pivoted for the Augment to have better usability with Damage Reduction application.''
**Duration gained per kill now scales with Ability Duration Mods.

{{ver|36}}
*Fixed Chroma’s Guardian Armor Augment not triggering Archon Intensify when healing allies.

{{ver|35.5.3}}
*Clarified Chroma’s Guardian Armor Augment Mod description to specify “squadmates” instead of “allies” since it only affects player controlled characters. 
**It now reads: “Chroma's Health takes 50% of damage dealt to squadmates within Affinity Range. Squad kills restore 5% of his Health over 3s and increases Vex Armor duration by 1s”.
*Fixed being able to equip both Vexing Retaliation and Guardian Armor Augment Mods on Chroma. 
**Only one Augment is allowed to be equipped per Ability.

{{ver|35.5.2}}
*Fixed squad kills not contributing towards the Host Chroma’s “Guardian Armor” Augment Mod, which meant it wasn’t restoring the Host’s Health and didn’t increase Vex Armor’s Duration as intended.

{{ver|35.5.1}}
*Added a duration cap to Chroma’s Guardian Armor Augment Mod.
**This Augment was intended to offer players a way to extend its duration but was released uncapped, resulting in some pretty impressive numbers. For the sake of balance, we have capped this bonus time at your current modded Vex Armor duration.

{{ver|35.5}}
*Introduced.
